## Verified scope

- Added `UniversalValidatedPerformanceProjection` as a read-only projection that retains the exact original specialized `PerformanceComparisonHistoryRecord` plus its exact Slice 3 `UniversalTuningCandidate` binding.
- Added `BlueStacksUniversalValidatedPerformanceBridge.TryProject(...)`.
- `PerformanceComparisonHistoryRecord.CanOriginateProfile` remains the first authority gate. Universal metadata cannot make it true.
- The bridge defensively rehydrates the record and fails closed on invalid additive context.
- Candidate and Validation must both be fully `Measured`.
- Validation must be captured later than Candidate.
- Candidate and Validation must retain exact equivalent `PerformanceConfigurationSnapshot` values.
- Candidate and Validation must both contain valid `PerformanceUniversalConfigurationContext` values and those contexts must be exactly equivalent.
- Universal `GameId` and `AdapterId` must match the stable Slice 3 candidate-space identity and exact resolved adapter.
- Specialized configuration `Game` must match `candidateSpace.Identity.LegacyGameKind`; cross-workload projection fails closed.
- The specialized candidate configuration must map to exactly one Slice 3 binding by CPU/RAM/FPS/renderer/resolution. Zero or ambiguous matches return no projection.
- Full specialized Candidate↔Validation equivalence continues to own BlueStacks instance, DPI and structural environment matching.
- Legacy validated History without `UniversalContext` remains valid through the specialized profile-origin path but receives no universal projection. No historical context is invented.
- Observed and PendingValidation records remain blocked.
- An adversarial non-Measured Candidate is blocked by the universal projection even when the legacy `CanOriginateProfile` property itself remains true; the legacy property is not modified.
- Universal candidate/validation context mismatch, cross-machine context, GameId/workload mismatch, AdapterId mismatch and zero/ambiguous binding all fail closed.
- No new `Validated`, winner, `PerformanceProfile`, recommendation, persistence or mutation authority was created.
- No changes were made to `HistoryService`, `ProfileService`, `PerformanceProfile`, `ProfileChallengeService`, `ProfileChallengeRoundService`, incumbent freshness/winner replacement, typed PresentMon authority, Global Controlled Benchmark Lease, rollback or startup behavior.

