## Preserved authority boundary

Canonical chain remains:

```text
specialized controlled measurement / History
        ↓
Observed
        ↓
PendingValidation
        ↓
later independent fully Measured validation
        ↓
exact specialized configuration equivalence
        ↓
CanOriginateProfile
        ↓
optional exact universal correlation
```

Universal correlation is downstream, additive and read-only. Failure to correlate universally does not rewrite or invalidate a specialized record that remains valid under the existing profile-origin rules.

